{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"Two friends both grab the same blue marker and begin to argue.","words":[[0,0.28],[0.37,0.79],[0.88,1.2],[1.26,1.58],[1.65,1.72],[1.78,2.04],[2.09,2.37],[2.43,2.84],[2.91,3.03],[3.1,3.39],[3.46,3.53],[3.62,4.5]]},{"text":"Their teacher says, Pause. Hands safe. Voices soft.","words":[[0,0.31],[0.37,0.73],[0.79,1.13],[1.21,1.81],[2.1,2.44],[2.48,3],[3.2,3.65],[3.71,4.5]]},{"text":"Each child takes one breath to calm down.","words":[[0,0.3],[0.4,0.78],[0.82,1.1],[1.18,1.39],[1.45,1.79],[1.85,1.94],[2.01,2.31],[2.39,3.16]]},{"text":"Mika says, I felt upset when the marker was taken from me.","words":[[0,0.37],[0.44,0.95],[1.2,1.25],[1.39,1.64],[1.7,2.19],[2.25,2.44],[2.48,2.55],[2.62,3.01],[3.08,3.23],[3.3,3.61],[3.68,3.89],[3.96,4.5]]},{"text":"Jon says, I felt rushed because I needed blue for the sky.","words":[[0,0.34],[0.43,0.85],[0.92,0.99],[1.13,1.41],[1.51,1.85],[1.9,2.26],[2.31,2.33],[2.42,2.73],[2.79,3.06],[3.12,3.26],[3.32,3.41],[3.47,4.37]]},{"text":"They listen to each other without interrupting.","words":[[0,0.26],[0.34,0.67],[0.74,0.81],[0.89,1.1],[1.17,1.39],[1.47,1.89],[1.96,3.2]]},{"text":"Together they make a plan: two minutes each, then switch.","words":[[0,0.53],[0.6,0.77],[0.85,1.08],[1.13,1.15],[1.22,1.78],[1.99,2.21],[2.29,2.67],[2.74,3.09],[3.15,3.39],[3.48,4.32]]},{"text":"Jon apologizes for grabbing. Mika apologizes for yelling.","words":[[0,0.29],[0.36,1.18],[1.25,1.41],[1.47,2.04],[2.29,2.62],[2.68,3.51],[3.58,3.74],[3.81,4.6]]},{"text":"They finish the drawing and add a bright rainbow together.","words":[[0,0.26],[0.33,0.66],[0.72,0.79],[0.85,1.28],[1.35,1.46],[1.57,1.75],[1.81,1.83],[1.9,2.24],[2.31,2.75],[2.83,3.71]]},{"text":"Both learn conflicts can be fixed with calm words and fair plans.","words":[[0,0.4],[0.45,0.72],[0.81,1.41],[1.49,1.67],[1.74,1.85],[1.93,2.28],[2.3,2.5],[2.57,2.93],[3,3.34],[3.39,3.51],[3.6,3.88],[3.96,4.83]]}]}